{"title":"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems\">2004 AMC 12A #4</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">2004 AMC 10A #6</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(From_Alcumus)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (From Alcumus)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Bertha has 6 daughters and no sons.  Some of her daughters have 6 daughters, and the rest have none.  Bertha has a total of 30 daughters and granddaughters, and no great-granddaughters.  How many of Bertha's daughters and grand-daughters have no daughters?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/9/6999c3a0ad7a987b759cb1146ee3c1c8c2b44daf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 22 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 23 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 24 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 25 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"387\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Since Bertha has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> daughters, she has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/f/1eff47e94ac3bd560478db9e80b03701ddfc63e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30-6=24$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"91\" height=\"13\" /> granddaughters, of which none have daughters.  Of Bertha's daughters, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/f/9cf1fe37856f39cc559b677007bb7ae98012d177.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{24}6=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"55\" height=\"37\" /> have daughters, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/6/d56aacf9a0d82d29b182703eb0e93c4ba73c3149.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6-4=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" /> do not have daughters. Therefore, of Bertha's daughters and granddaughters, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/e/46e604ffaf76c5a6e01289b70b7260e5355becf5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24+2=26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"91\" height=\"14\" /> do not have daughters.  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/8/828b2127ccab926d5383d0401007ed20bc150b5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 26}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"62\" height=\"29\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Solution_2_.28From_Alcumus.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(From_Alcumus)\">Solution 2 (From Alcumus)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (From Alcumus)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Bertha has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/e/51e25bdc5bfc47457524a7159c159461c5ee1e32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30 - 6 = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"91\" height=\"13\" /> granddaughters, none of whom have any daughters. The granddaughters are the children of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/e/cee8dfd77de6adc9f5cbddba6341ef59f40f0cc0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24/6 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" /> of Bertha's daughters, so the number of women having no daughters is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/2/3820615f36bba02040c2a8a0787ca141a4e0419c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30 - 4 = \\boxed{26}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"103\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Draw a tree diagram and see that the answer can be found in the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/1/ce1e744bcff4b1d4eb799727e596cc620f60db7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6+6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" /> granddaughters, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/2/fd265cc0f66a0e03ae56d0acdc7a9b1b058c8f59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5+5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" /> daughters, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more daughters.  Adding them together gives the answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/8/828b2127ccab926d5383d0401007ed20bc150b5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 26}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"62\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/HfOIeW-TGhc\">https://youtu.be/HfOIeW-TGhc</a>\n</p><p>Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A\">2004 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A 